Installed-Size: {SIZE}
Depends: libc6 (>= {GLIBC}), libgcc-s1, libxkbcommon0, libxkbcommon-x11-0, libx11-6, libx11-xcb1, libxcb1, libxcursor1, libxi6, libgl1, libegl1
Recommends: xdg-desktop-portal, libwayland-client0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/Antidote1911/cryptyrust
Description: Post-quantum file encryption, drag-and-drop GUI and command line
 Cryptyrust protects files with a password, with the public keys of the
 people who must be able to open them, or with both. Files dropped on the
 window are encrypted or decrypted; the same program is a command-line tool
 when it is given arguments.
 .
 Encryption is hybrid (X25519 + ML-KEM) with Argon2id key derivation, in the
 documented Arsenic V2 file format.
